OL,3,AFive killed and a dozen more injured in
OL,4,AKrakow shooting, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolish police say five people have been
OL,7,Fkilled, and about a dozen more are
OL,8,Finjured, after a shooting in Krakow -
OL,9,Fwhat we know so far
OL,11,F"Shots were fired in the Main Market
OL,12,FSquare," a statement says
OL,14,FVideo shows gunshots ringing out in the
OL,15,Fsquare; images show emergency services
OL,16,Fat the scene
OL,18,FPolice say the suspect - who was shot
OL,19,Fby officers - is being taken to
OL,20,Fhospital
